  "How do I sign the CLA?": {
    "question": "How do I sign the CLA?",
    "answer": "To sign the CLA, follow these steps:\n\n1. After creating your first Pull Request, the linux-foundation-easycla bot will respond with information regarding your CLA status along with a link to sign the CLA. [2]\n\n2. If you are signing up as a corporate contributor, ensure that you have linked your corporate email address to your GitHub profile. [2]\n\n3. Click on the **Please click here to be authorized** link to navigate to the GitHub Authorize Linux Foundation: EasyCLA page. [1]\n\n4. Then click **Authorize LF-Engineering** to give the Linux Foundation read-only access to list the email addresses associated with your GitHub account. [1]\n\n5. Select the most appropriate contributor type: Individual Contributor or Corporate Contributor. [1]\n\n6. Follow the instructions to complete the signing process through DocuSign. [1]",
