  "What are the requirements to become a reviewer?": {
    "question": "What are the requirements to become a reviewer?",
    "answer": "To become a reviewer, one must:\n\n- Gain a high level of proficiency in understanding API conventions, project structure, and the underlying architecture [1].\n- Be committed to the SIG activities [2].\n- Demonstrate technical depth [2].\n- Have accumulated enough context [2].\n- Be knowledgeable about the codebase [2].\n- Be trustworthy and have established trust with the community [2].\n- Be sponsored by a subproject approver [2].\n- Have no objections from other approvers [2].\n- Have been a primary reviewer for at least 5 PRs to the codebase [4].\n- Have reviewed or merged at least 20 substantial PRs to the codebase [4].",
